I have one board question. I feel like given the form of L1 -- which already penalizes a decoder failure, any addition to the Loss function besides L1 is futile. On that note, is adding L3 a moot point? I still am not a 100% convinced which is why I'd do the sweep you built for me. But while that is sitting on the cluster, I want to do a science exploration. I want to revisit the idea of having CER information inform the training of the Neural network in the form of soft checks -- something you suggested a while ago in the past. I want to leave no stones unturned, and hence flush this idea out. If need be I can do this on a new branch. But before we touch the code, the idea first!